WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.429 --> 00:00:22.539
OK.

00:00:22.539 --> 00:00:26.630
I don't want to spend a ton of time on this,
but I want to cover two really crazy reactions

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:31.800
to the Biden Harris campaign sort of coming
together in the last 24, 48 hours that we've

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:32.800
seen.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:39.900
The first is remember that wacky Fox News
host, former Judge Jeanine Pirro.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:45.910
She sort of suggested last night that she
knows something about how Joe Biden is not

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:48.469
actually going to be on the ticket by November.

00:00:48.469 --> 00:00:53.430
She suggests something is going to happen
to Joe Biden between now and November, although

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:54.930
she doesn't actually say what.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:55.950
Let's look at the clip.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.760
Well, I have a lot of thoughts.

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:00.420
The first thought that I have, Jesse, is up
for some reason.

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:04.379
I just have this feeling that Joe Biden isn't
going to be on the ticket.

00:01:04.379 --> 00:01:09.940
I have a sense that something is going to
happen before the election and he's not even

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:10.940
going to be on the ticket.

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:13.190
So don't even ask me if he's going to make
the four years.

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:16.729
But let me just tell you a little bit about
what I saw.

00:01:16.729 --> 00:01:18.740
So immediately the questions start.

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:20.050
Is this a death threat?

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:26.409
Is Jeanine Pirro trying to suddenly suggest
to her audience that someone do something

00:01:26.409 --> 00:01:27.490
about Joe Biden?

00:01:27.490 --> 00:01:33.140
Is this merely some kind of allusion to a
health issue she believes Joe Biden's going

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:36.200
to have between now and November?

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:40.350
Is Pirro merely drunk again and unable to
cohere during her program?

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.650
It's not totally clear.

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:48.750
The sort of most dangerous and sort of insidious
interpretation of this would be the stochastic

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.560
terrorism type situation.

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:58.300
Now, she's, of course, not saying anybody
should do anything, but the idea of stochastic

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:06.210
terrorism is that given a large enough audience,
if you plant an idea that something could

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:14.209
be done, that it becomes statistically likely
that you would influence one person to do

00:02:14.209 --> 00:02:15.430
something there.

00:02:15.430 --> 00:02:21.189
The first time that we discussed stochastic
terrorism on this program was back in.

00:02:21.189 --> 00:02:27.299
I don't even remember what year when Glenn
Beck was ranting and raving about the Tides

00:02:27.299 --> 00:02:28.299
Foundation.

00:02:28.299 --> 00:02:31.969
He had all sorts of ideas and conspiracy theories
about the Tides Foundation.

00:02:31.969 --> 00:02:39.080
And it actually led to a particular guy getting
weapons and was was stopped on the highway.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:40.370
I believe I'm going from memory.

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:45.090
I believe it was in California on his way
to attack the Tides Foundation.

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:52.400
And, of course, Glenn Beck would not be held
legally responsible for that if the if the

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.010
shooting or bombing or whatever were to be
carried out.

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:59.379
But the guy who was on the way said, yeah,
I watchbox at the time Glenn Beck was on Fox

00:02:59.379 --> 00:03:00.379
News.

00:03:00.379 --> 00:03:02.329
I walked watch Fox News and watch Glenn Beck.

00:03:02.329 --> 00:03:04.689
And it's it's sort of it's anathema.

00:03:04.689 --> 00:03:10.109
It's a statistical thing where if zero point
zero one percent of an audience is likely

00:03:10.109 --> 00:03:13.969
to actually do the violence that is implied
by a host.

00:03:13.969 --> 00:03:18.469
If you have 100 people in your audience, it's
unlikely to reach the threshold of one person

00:03:18.469 --> 00:03:19.529
going and doing something.

00:03:19.529 --> 00:03:21.629
If you have a thousand people, it's unlikely.

00:03:21.629 --> 00:03:25.819
But once you get to an audience of one hundred
thousand of five hundred thousand of a million,

00:03:25.819 --> 00:03:32.870
two million, even a small likelihood of influencing
someone becomes likely to actually influence

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:37.450
one, five, 10, 15 people to go and carry out
an action.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:43.629
So that would be like the most uncharitable
interpretation of what Jeanine Pirro is doing

00:03:43.629 --> 00:03:44.629
here.

00:03:44.629 --> 00:03:50.419
What what is unbelievable is that this is
happening on one of the country's largest

00:03:50.419 --> 00:03:54.430
three cable news networks and it's happening
in prime time.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:58.629
And at least as far as we know right now,
there is no repercussions for it.

00:03:58.629 --> 00:04:02.209
There is no blowback whatsoever from the perspective
of Fox News.

00:04:02.209 --> 00:04:06.700
Now, in terms of whether anybody would really
be able to do anything to Joe Biden, Joe Biden

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:08.010
has Secret Service protection.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:10.469
Kamala Harris does as well now.

00:04:10.469 --> 00:04:14.000
And Secret Service is good at their job in
terms of protecting people.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:17.049
And I imagine that Joe Biden's safety is well
handled.

00:04:17.049 --> 00:04:22.079
So that would point more to the idea that
she's floating of some kind of health situation

00:04:22.079 --> 00:04:23.079
for Joe Biden.

00:04:23.079 --> 00:04:26.650
So that's number one in terms of the just
wacky reactions to Biden.

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:32.389
Harris getting a lot of attention in the first
24 to 48 hours after the announcement of Kamala

00:04:32.389 --> 00:04:34.310
Harris joining the campaign.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:39.229
Let's now go to number two, which we are not
now.

